@startuml match_runtime
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Whole-match child with owner reconstruction and C12 learners
start
:Durable STARTED / frozen model, baseline and streams;
:Child canonical ready; owner independently initializes;
repeat
  :Child opens; owner reconstructs native result / recipients / provenance;
  if (Terminal, exhausted source or actual cap?) then (yes)
    :Compare owner-derived stop and compact completed prefixes;
    break
  endif
  :Issue first required 10-second permit before writing;
  :Child prepares only the permitted side from frozen precommit state;
  :Owner reconstructs candidate or strategic result;
  :Feed candidate features to both owned learners; ACK exact journal;
  :Issue next side permit or release one whole-pair admission;
  :Child settles or reports typed native denial;
  :Owner reexecutes exact accepted / recorded pair;
repeat while (Continue?) is (yes)
:Require child and frozen scorer natural close / EOF / reap;
:Compare both uncommitted Burn proposals;
:Require both learner natural close / EOF / reap;
:Atomically publish completion only through selected private store;
note right
  Candidate timeout uses owner clock and owned whole-group cleanup.
  Finish only the last known ACKed prefix after cleanup.
  Infrastructure errors abort all without reward or retry.
end note
stop
@enduml
